          human: "Illustrated Tarokk (Illusztrált Tarokk) is the most complex and rewarding variant of Hungarian Tarokk. While based on the 42-card 'Twenty-Calling' (Paskievics) version, it adds a massive layer of additional bonuses (Figurák) that make it a game of high-stakes declarations and daring tactical plays. In this variant, winning the basic game is often secondary to fulfilling high-value bonus contracts like 'Huszonegyfogás' (Catching the XXI).",
